  "Sample/Report.ssl": {
   "text": "/********************************************************************************\nDescription.. : Sample script for SSL Studio: calls into Orders.\nParameters... : -\nReturns...... : -\nAuthor....... :\nDate......... : 2026-11-01\n********************************************************************************\n_______________________________________________________________________________\nModification. :\nAuthor....... :\nDate......... :\n_______________________________________________________________________________\n********************************************************************************/;\n\n/*\n * Procedure: CustomerSummary\n * Description: A one-line summary of a customer's open orders.\n * Parameters:\n *   sCustomer - the customer code\n * Returns: the summary text\n;\n:PROCEDURE CustomerSummary;\n\t:PARAMETERS sCustomer;\n\n\t:DECLARE nOpen, sTitle;\n\n\tnOpen := ExecFunction(\"Sample.Orders.CountOpenOrders\", {sCustomer});\n\tsTitle := DoProc(\"ReportTitle\", {sCustomer});\n\n\t:RETURN sTitle + \": \" + LimsString(nOpen) + \" open\";\n:ENDPROC;\n\n/*\n * Procedure: ReportTitle\n * Description: The report's title line.\n * Parameters:\n *   sCustomer - the customer code\n * Returns: the title\n;\n:PROCEDURE ReportTitle;\n\t:PARAMETERS sCustomer;\n\n\t:RETURN \"Customer \" + sCustomer;\n:ENDPROC;\n",
